{"content":[{"id":"20b67f0e","settings":{"flex_direction":"row","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"boxed_width":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"background_background":"classic","background_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":"","alt":"Historique","source":"library"},"tp_display_rules":[{"_id":"8bdf6a5"}],"as_bs_lists":[],"as_bs_lists_h":[],"as_ts_lists":[],"as_ts_lists_h":[],"as_ds_lists":[],"as_ds_lists_h":[],"boxed_width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"boxed_width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"eventRepeater":[{"_id":"3761baf"}]},"elements":[{"id":"244b0a20","settings":{"editor":"<p class=\"p1\">Extraordinaire soir\u00e9e polyn\u00e9sienne de 18h \u00e0 22h. <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-size ); font-style: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-style ); text-transform: var( --e-global-typography-text-text-transform ); text-align: var(--text-align); background-color: var( --e-global-color-955fbbc );\">Une soir\u00e9e exceptionnelle dans un cadre pr\u00e9serv\u00e9. <\/span>Vous serez accueillis au son du Ukulele d\u00e8s votre arriv\u00e9e au village. Nous vous ferons ensuite d\u00e9couvrir le four traditionnel tahitien (Ahi Maa), o\u00f9 les sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9s culinaires de votre d\u00eener cuisent \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9touff\u00e9e depuis midi, entour\u00e9es de feuilles de bananiers et enterr\u00e9es dans le sol avec des pierres volcaniques chaudes. Vous d\u00e9couvrirez \u00e9galement les secrets du village, avant de vous installer \u00e0 table pour d\u00e9guster les mets tahitiens traditionnels typiques et bien d\u2019autres sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9s culinaires de notre chef dispos\u00e9s sur 3 buffets :<br \/>- Entr\u00e9es chaudes et froides<br \/>- Plats chauds<br \/>- Desserts<br \/>Tous les plats sont pr\u00e9par\u00e9s avec des produits frais et de saisons. Vous assisterez au par\u00e9o show, o\u00f9 une jolie Vahin\u00e9 et un de nos danseurs vous montreront les milles et une fa\u00e7on de sublimer votre par\u00e9o. Ensuite nous vous invitons \u00e0 vous installer au coeur de notre amphith\u00e9\u00e2tre de verdure avec vue imprenable sur le lagon, afin d\u2019assister \u00e0 la grande revue du Tiki Village, un spectacle unique en Polyn\u00e9sie.<\/p>","tp_display_rules":[{"_id":"d39ed8f"}],"as_bs_lists":[],"as_bs_lists_h":[],"as_ts_lists":[],"as_ts_lists_h":[],"as_ds_lists":[],"as_ds_lists_h":[],"__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals\/typography?id=secondary","text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"},"_flex_align_self":"center","drop_cap":"yes","eventRepeater":[{"_id":"9bd32d0"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"2928fd61","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":40},"_flex_size":"none","tp_display_rules":[{"_id":"2f59286"}],"as_bs_lists":[],"as_bs_lists_h":[],"as_ts_lists":[],"as_ts_lists_h":[],"as_ds_lists":[],"as_ds_lists_h":[],"_element_width":"initial","eventRepeater":[{"_id":"6e0345b"}]},"elements":[{"id":"4a551a37","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/www.tikivillage.pf\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/20221018_1915_SSAYEB_1823.jpg","id":61708,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"width":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"space":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"height":{"unit":"px","size":373,"sizes":[]},"object-fit":"cover","tp_display_rules":[{"_id":"329c4e2"}],"as_bs_lists":[],"as_bs_lists_h":[],"as_ts_lists":[],"as_ts_lists_h":[],"as_ds_lists":[],"as_ds_lists_h":[],"eventRepeater":[{"_id":"5adfa42"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"image","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"container"}],"settings":[],"metadata":[]}